WEBVTT

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:55.460
Spectacular!

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:57.970
Indeed, this is a splendid view!

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.430
What are we going to do about that ball?

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:03.790
Can the M1-R Prototype really stop it?

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.420
I think it can.

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:10.010
I never go into a battle 
with no chance of victory!

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:11.850
Then, how?

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:15.700
You people know about gyroscopes, right?

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:16.890
Yes, we do.

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:19.050
They're sensors used for 
maintaining balance, correct?

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:20.160
That's right.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:23.990
Their system may be different than ours,

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:28.370
but I'm sure that sphere has 
some function like that.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.830
I see! So you aim for...

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:34.230
We can't take the thing head on.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:36.690
This is a chance, after all.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:40.840
With a tad bit of ingenuity, 
I'm sure we can stop it!

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:45.840
But that sphere is unaffected 
by attacks, EM waves, or scans.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:48.800
And our weapon is still incomplete!

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.960
There's two or three layers to my plan.

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.860
Then why haven't we done it yet?

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:58.200
I want to show off!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:05.260
If we want direct access to the government, 
we need to put on a good show!

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.450
Anyway, how are the White 
House's preparations coming?

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.750
They are proceeding as scheduled.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.960
Oh, I see...

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.640
30 minutes until operation start.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:36.150
Joey!!

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.690
I understand now.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:50.250
It was that boy which was controlling him!

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.750
In other words, without that little boy,

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:58.070
the white one is nothing 
but a worthless puppet!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:28.980
What?

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:38.920
Joey!

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.240
I'm okay!

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:48.570
Still alive after taking that hit? I 
guess you really aren't a normal human.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.280
However!

00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:01.150
My calculations... are never wrong!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:14.910
This is over!

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.920
Joey!

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:37.260
Hey, Joey! Wake up!

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.440
Joey!

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.120
We're through...

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:48.740
I win!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:53.530
All that's left is to crush the 
leftover weaklings and finish up.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:12.900
That's...

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:14.350
Heroman is...

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:16.850
...shining...

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.080
But what is it?

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:28.400
What is that shining light?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.490
Heroman's acting strange...

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.330
That's nothing...

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:43.240
He's strong... But...

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:46.940
He's not fighting anymore...

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.820
It's like he's...

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:50.740
...out of control!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.390
S-Stop it...

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.330
Please, stop!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.260
H-Heroman?

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:58.320
Heroman!

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:02.820
That's enough, Heroman!

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.610
Don't!

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:19.310
You mustn't fight like that!

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:22.010
Because... You're...

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:25.280
...my Heroman!

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.510
Heroman...

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:06.700
Looks like you have trouble 
finishing people off!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.620
You damn brat!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.260
Heroman!

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.200
Too late!

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:45.370
Heroman...

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:47.540
Blast!

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:05.460
Hey!

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:09.620
You okay, Joey?

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:16.380
You did great, Joey!

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:36.430
To think I'd be outmatched 
on this backwoods planet...

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:39.110
But I won't let it end here!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:45.030
I'll send you all... to hell!

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:48.130
W-What are you...

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:52.240
We Skrugg will never accept defeat!

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:58.330
I'll blow up this base and you along with it!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:13.170
In the end I cannot allow 
you to stop the plan!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.800
What should we do?

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:25.870
Get outta here?

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:29.590
No, we still have something we need to do.

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:31.290
We need to do?

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.540
Those spheres!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.410
Even if this place explodes, 
they'll keep rolling.

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:39.170
This is our last chance!

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:43.340
We have to stop those spheres 
before this place is destroyed!

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:47.160
So, where should we go?

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:52.790
The controls should be 
where Kogorr came from.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.280
The top floor, probably!

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:31.540
Here?

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:34.000
Yes, I'm sure this is it.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.680
And the controls are...

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.340
There!

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:51.710
Now, then...

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:58.200
What's the matter, Professor?

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.220
Start the clicky-clackin' already!

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:02.520
Don't you get it, you two?

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:06.740
This work is very delicate, and 
requires precise operation!

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:07.880
Why?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:12.310
If I screw up and hit the self-destruct 
switch, there's no turning back!

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:14.850
That switch has already 
been pushed, remember?!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.430
Hurry up, Professor!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.800
F-F-Fine!

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:28.230
Heroman... Go!

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:36.360
Quickly!

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.200
I-I know!

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:53.370
Mr. President, leave 
everything to me, Minami!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.200
We're counting on you.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.680
3 minutes to operation start.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:00.270
Now, shall we begin?

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:14.420
Ladies and gentlemen...

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:21.420
It's showtime!

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:24.900
Do you understand it?

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:27.970
There's nothing I like less as a scientist...

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:32.460
Activating some unknown device using 
only guesswork and supposition...

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:36.900
But there are linguistic rules 
common to all morphologies...

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:41.970
And I worked a bit with their technology.

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.380
Hurry up, faster!

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:53.910
I know!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.710
Damn it!

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:07.170
Stop! Stop! Stop!

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.710
Professor!

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.690
30 seconds until sphere is 
within area of effectiveness.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:18.110
28, 27, 26, 25,

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:22.580
24, 23, 22, 21,

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:27.530
20, 19, 18, 17, 16,

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:27.530
Now begins the dawn of a new era... Mine!

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:32.740
15, 14, 13, 12, 11,

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:38.240
10, 9, 8, 7, 6,

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.230
That's...

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:40.330
I don't care anymore, just stop!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:43.410
5, 4, 3, 2, 1...

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.410
Sphere Capture Plan...

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:48.420
Begin!

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:58.630
The sphere has ceased movement.

00:17:58.630 --> 00:17:59.470
What?!

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:17.160
Aw, it stopped.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:19.280
And we didn't do anything.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.520
They stopped...

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:30.240
Okay! Next to stop the self-destruct...

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:37.690
Professor!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:40.190
Looks like that's all I can do.

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:41.780
We did everything we planned to!

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:43.880
Now we just have to get outta here!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:44.850
Joey!

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:47.250
Heroman...

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:49.850
Finish!

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:04.930
Joey...

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.970
Joey!

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:01.280
Psy, Psy!

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:07.550
Professor! Hey, Professor!

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:10.050
I'm alive...

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:17.930
It's over.

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:19.200
Yeah.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:22.720
And so, peace returns to Center City.

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.140
Thank goodness.

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:25.470
Good going, Joey.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:26.690
Yeah!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.970
Thank you, Heroman.

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:49.980
It's a good thing we didn't have to depend 
on that weapon we don't really understand.

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:52.050
Ah, all's well that ends well!

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:54.000
It wasn't something to be so worried about.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.830
Why those... Who did this?

00:21:56.830 --> 00:22:00.120
Who got in my way?

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:24.090
<b>"Can you hear this voice?"</b>

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:31.560
<b>I've been calling that, always, from deep within my heart.</b>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:45.460
<b>Would you, all alone, let another lonely one be next to you?</b>

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:51.010
<b>Because together it's not lonely, it's twoly.</b>

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:56.140
<b>See, you're not alone any longer.</b>

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:59.990
<b>Just because there's no one next to me</b>

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:02.540
<b>doesn't mean that I'm lonely!</b>

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:07.740
<b>For someone to notice this pain</b>

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:13.270
<b>that heart must have surely cried.</b>

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.650
<b>Right now, we'll crush to bits</b>

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:20.350
<b>the fortress of our limitless sadness!</b>

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:24.050
<b>I'll take you with me!</b>

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:27.730
<b>Got it? I'm running through at full power.</b>

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:31.470
<b>To where you're waiting, left behind</b>

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:34.640
<b>in the place of tears...</b>

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:39.770
<b>I believe in you, with burning passion!</b>

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:43.560
<b>Come to me!</b>

00:23:51.150 --> 00:23:53.550
On the next Heroman:

00:23:53.550 --> 00:23:57.080
It's over! Now I can concentrate 
on my part-time job again!

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:58.980
Time to work!

00:23:58.980 --> 00:24:03.530
The battle is over, and it seems 
like peace has returned to the city.

00:24:03.530 --> 00:24:07.090
Joey and the gang should 
have saved the world,

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:11.470
but new tendrils of evil have begun to 
creep up and are steadily closing in.

00:24:12.280 --> 00:24:16.100
Next time on Heroman #10: Approach!

00:24:16.100 --> 00:24:18.650
Heroman... Attack!
